#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/at.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid "Linux PAM Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Linux PAM"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/at.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <application>At</application> has been built with <application>Linux "
"PAM</application> support, you need to create a "
"<application>PAM</application> configuration file, to get it working "
"correctly with BLFS."
msgstr ""
"Se <application>At</application> tiver sido construído com suporte "
"<application>Linux PAM</application>, [então] você precisa criar um arquivo "
"de configuração <application>PAM</application>, para fazê-lo funcionar "
"corretamente com BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/at.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Issue the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user to create the configuration file "
"for <application>Linux PAM</application>:"
msgstr ""
"Emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> para criar o arquivo de configuração "
"para <application>Linux PAM</application>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/at.xml:169
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/atd &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/atd\n"
"\n"
"auth     required pam_unix.so\n"
"account  required pam_unix.so\n"
"password required pam_unix.so\n"
"session  required pam_unix.so\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/atd</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/atd &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/pam.d/atd\n"
"\n"
"auth     required pam_unix.so\n"
"account  required pam_unix.so\n"
"password required pam_unix.so\n"
"session  required pam_unix.so\n"
"\n"
"# Termina /etc/pam.d/atd</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/at.xml:183
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Boot Script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Systemd Unit</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Conjunto de Comandos Sequenciais de "
"Inicialização</phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\">Unidade do "
"systemd</phrase>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/at.xml:187
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install the <filename>/etc/init.d/atd</filename> init script from the <xref "
"linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> package."
msgstr ""
"Instale o script de inicialização <filename>/etc/init.d/atd</filename> a "
"partir do pacote <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/at.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start the <command>atd</command> daemon at boot, enable the previously "
"installed systemd unit by running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o processo de segundo plano <command>atd</command> na "
"inicialização, habilite a unidade do systemd instalada anteriormente "
"executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/at.xml:202
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-atd</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-atd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/at.xml:204
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>systemctl enable atd</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl enable atd</userinput>"

